              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ochikwa ngo ompö ani nya Tiro nko Sidon nko koroswo Pilistia? Ayo mi kïgh nyo omökekwa oghokwanïn? Nyo ato mi kïgh nyo oyokwanïkwa, ayokwokwa nyu lawel kïrïp kegh nko wölo lata ighisyewutkökwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompöwölo kyoritökwa silpenichan nko koltinechan orityikwa sïkönötenyan korikwo pö saghat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kyopökwa pipö Yuda nko Yerusalem oltochï pipö Krik anategha kïlowöchitunö korengwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyokunan chane kïpkana koroswechoni kyolchikwa, ayokwokwa apele ompö kïgh löwïr nyo kyoghchikwa chane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOL 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onkoghchinan werkökwa nko tipikwa werpö Yuda kwalta kwoltochï Sapea, kor nyo low nyoman.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOL.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOL.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
